1. e4 e5 2. Nf3 Nc6 3. d4 exd4 4. Nxd4 Bc5 5. Be3 { white sets up the trap, but black will often play qf6. } { [%cal Ge3c5] } 5... Qf6 { [%cal Rf6b2,Rc5e3] } 6. Nb5 { here white MUST play Nb5 almost everything else loses. } 6... Qxb2?? 7. N1c3!! { white doesn't even take on c7! trapping the queen is better, black has no way to stop rb1. } 7... Kd8 { [%csl Rc7][%cal Gd8c7] } 8. Rb1 { the queen is trapped. } { [%csl Rb2][%cal Rb1b2] } *

