1. e4 e5 2. Nf3 Nc6 3. d4 exd4 4. Bc4 { This is the Scotch gambit. } 4... Be7 5. c3! { white gambits another pawn. } 5... dxc3?? { but black is to greedy white is now winning with qd5. } 6. Qd5 { no way to defend except give up a piece with Nh6! } { [%csl Rf7][%cal Rc4f7] } 6... Nh6 7. Bxh6 O-O 8. Bc1 { white is up a piece. } { [%cal Gc3b2,Gc1b2] } *

